title: 'Two audits of our own repo, and the first fixes from each: the Stop hook is seven times lighter and lint passes'
summary: 'With builders busy on dimensions, two read-only audits ran over Paradigm and Gnomon: performance (Bolt) and symbol hygiene (Rune, Cid). The first work package from each merged into feat/gnomon-dimensions the same night: PR #108 (the compliance check and doctor stop walking the whole tree) and PR #106 (this repo''s symbol index is whole; `paradigm lint` exits 0).'
