learnings:
  - 'Measure where a person waits before optimising: the per-turn hook mattered, the path a reviewer suspected did not'
  - 'When speeding up an enforcement check, review it as a safety change: ask which files the new method can no longer see'
  - A repo that dogfoods a framework should run the framework's own lint in CI; five unparsable files went unnoticed
  - An equivalence test between an old and a new method must include a case that blocks, or it proves nothing about blocking
  - Agents running test suites leave large temp directories; watch free disk on long unattended sessions
